Description: CSAF-Tool is a Python utility and library to generate and analyse CSAF 2.0
 documents. It creates security advisories with product trees and vulnerability 
 information, supports validation, and provides command-line tools for 
 generating and inspecting advisory files. Ideal for security professionals and 
 software vendors needing structured security advisory data processing.

